  "body": "### What is the issue with the Cookie Store API Standard?\n\n`delete(name)`'s steps specify:\n```\n1. Let |r| be the result of running [=delete a cookie=] with\n        |url|,\n        |name|,\n        null,\n        \"`/`\",\n        true, and\n        \"{{CookieSameSite/strict}}\".\n```\nbut `delete a cookie` specifies:\n```\nTo <dfn>delete a cookie</dfn> with\n|url|,\n|name|,\n|domain|,\n|path|, and\n|partitioned|\nrun the following steps:\n```\nwith the same site being hardcoded inside the algorithm steps.",
